      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "Lje2NPzcmRMVkrMH3hne",
          "name": "Bumpy Top.",
          "description": "- +6 Defense Rating\n- Regenerative: If it survives a Fight, it will regenerate any lost limbs over a month. New limbs look more acorn-y.\n- Camoflaged: If hanging from a tree, it has an Edge on Deftness Checks/Contests to remain hidden. It additionally benefits from the Sheltered Area Condition.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "jRq1aqMzIEZinaWaFk47",
          "name": "Nut Cracker.",
          "description": "- If the Acorn Crab is hanging from a tree, it may opt to fall as an Attack, hitting as a Master Weapon.\n\nDeftness Contest vs. Target\n- Success: The Target is Toppled underneath the shell, able to make a Might Contest at the beginning of each subsequent Turn to escape.\n- Failure: The Acorn Crab is Toppled, shell stuck in the ground.\n\nAn Acorn Crab can usually only perform its falling Attack once per Fight due to its slow climbing speed.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
