      "bio": {
        "background": "Created by: GoblinJunkyard [Discord]",
        "size": "Medium",
        "name": "Acorn Crab",
        "subname": "Rank 2 Boss",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "details": "[Obojima Port] One Tough Nut. Despite what their name would suggest, they are hug crab that have a penchant for climbing large trees and dining on acorns. Highly territorial and will defend their trees, often by falling from great heights and using their shells as battering rams atop the heads of interlopers.",
