      "notes": [
        {
          "description": "Acorn Crabs first warn aggressors to leave their territory, staying high in their trees unless further aggravated.\n- Stay high in its tree, using it for cover until someone is within range of its large shell to crush underneath.\n- Attack those without metal armor, the shiny metal making is uneasy.",
