      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "wAb7lWqa0pfrnc5YLjYe",
          "name": "Shroud of Secrets.",
          "description": "+4 Defense Rating.\n- Ghostly Float: Unaffected by Area Conditions and can move through solid objects.\n- Incorporeal Form: Reduces mundane damage by 1 Heart.\n- Spirit Sight: Can see the souls of living creatures or things infused with mana within 3 Areas or 100ft.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "DNMQMS7dH7onh4gTPkHO",
          "name": "Unearthly Bargain.",
          "description": "Edge on all Negotiation Contests.\nCurse: \n- If it makes a bargain with a character for a question and they fail to answer, they are cursed. When Cursed, it always know where they are and has an Edge on Attacks against them.\n- The Akaobata needs to be slain or the cursed person needs to fulfill its bargain to be cleaned.\n- While a question is left unanswered, it will reform in a few days to a month, depending on how many bargains left unfulfilled to empower it; more = quicker reform.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "luh5qyszllETMvk09ybj",
          "name": "Cursed Touch.",
          "description": "- Attacks as a Standard Weapon\n- After a successful Attack, it can attempt to curse the Target to weaken their will.\n- Aura Contest, on a success the Target is Dispirited and vulnerable to its spiritual Attacks.\n\nCursed Whispers: Attack that can target a Cursed Target up to 2 Areas away, dealing 2 Dark Damage.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
