      "notes": [
        {
          "description": "Make a bargain with the most despserate, torment them until they speak their secret.\n- Don't get in a fight, use the parties needs to get them to bargain. Flee if you can't, you can always wait until they are desperate.\n- Attack the Target with the lowest Aura.\n- Use ghostly form to get to places they cannot.",
