              "value": 5
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "description": "Despite its half formed appearance, the Atropal is capable of strategic thought and will:\n- Snipe enemies with Ray of Cold, forcing them to approach within range of its physical attacks and Negative Energy Aura.\n- Wear down annoying ranged enemies with Life Drain.\n- Summon undead to even the odds.\n- If desperate, break enemies mentally with its Wail.\n",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "rollDetails": [],
          "id": "DBMa0akRFxeJjA4o7MVe",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "tactics",
          "counters": {},
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "name": "Tactics",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "rollDetails": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "description": "It understands Dark Tongue, but it only speaks in obscene nonsense.",
          "name": "Communication",
          "modifiers": [],
          "value": 0,
          "id": "Ntrz5p3hvUCRqLHi17zk",
          "originId": "communication"
        },
        {
          "rollDetails": [],
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Habitat",
          "description": "Due to its disgusting nature, the Atropal could appear in any natural space if summoned or attracted to some rip created in space. It could also be found floating around in the void between worlds.",
          "id": "cjG1nkOm4vkZPU7IEdlU",
          "originId": "habitat",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "modifiers": [],
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "description": "The stench of rotted ichor, pure negative energy choking the air, nonsensical profanity in Dark Tongue.",
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "name": "Indicators",
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "indicators",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "id": "OTg2GH2abw8CnphoYRBP",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "value": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "rollDetails": []
        },
        {
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "value": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "counters": {},
          "description": "While capable of complex thought and strategy, the atropal will most often attack anything that means it harm or threatens whatever it may be feeding on unless instructed otherwise by whatever powerful entity summoned it (if it being summoned is a factor).\n\nGive its Ray of Frost a chance to freeze enemies in place or change the Special Damage type to something else entirely. Maybe make it a fully formed entity so its speed and Deftness go up slightly, making it harder to hit.\n\nThe atropal could be reskinned as an Unshaped\u2019s nightmare conjured by its potent imagination.",
          "name": "Role Playing Notes",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "rollDetails": [],
          "originId": "role-playing-notes",
          "id": "v0qTdpe9Mn52Vnrvpjar",
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Yield",
          "rollDetails": [],
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": [],
          "type": "Loot",
          "description": "Umbilical Cord.\nIf severed from the Atropal before destroying said creature, the undead\u2019s cord can be used as a Crafting Additive.\n\nDefense: Imbued items will reduce Dark Damage by 1 Heart.\nAttack: Imbued weapons do Dark Damage.\nEldritch: All Creatures within the same Area as the wearer must make a Grit Check or take 1 Heart of Dark Damage.\n",
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "id": "RGRabawcHH0Dfexa8slm"
        }
      ]
    },
