          "id": "OZi1ZI6WzwwYrQbE6Xgc",
          "name": "Flying Chomp.",
          "description": "- Teeth bite as a Mighty Weapon.\n- As part of its Attack, it can lunge up to 1 Area towards its Target.\n\nAfter a successful Attack, it can latch onto its Target and drag it into its tunnel.\n- On a successful Might Contest, the Target is Restrained. The Target can attempt to escape at the beginning of each of its Turn by winning a Might Contest.\n- If the Bearracuda begins its Turn with a Target in its jaws, it can either Trash [Deal 1 Damage] or Drag [Move the Target 1 Area]",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "5GqTK7iZrxqLY4p3Uitp",
          "name": "Burrowing Giant.",
          "description": "The Bearracuda can burrow and when burrowing its Speed Rating is Average.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
