      "bio": {
        "background": "Created by: GoblinJunkyard [Discord]",
        "size": "Large",
        "name": "Bearracuda",
        "subname": "Rank 2 Boss",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "details": "[Obojima Port] Furry Fish.\nThe fur-covered bearracuda live on the snowy slopes of mountains and often symbolize its dangers. Once prized for their meat and fur, they proved too dangerous of prey.",
