      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "description": "Often grumpy after their hibernation, or exploring for their next meal.\n- Burrow underground quickly to avoid most threats.\n- Attack the smallest creature, taking it underground.\n- Use Combat Tricks to destabilize the earth underneath.",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "rollDetails": [],
          "id": "DBMa0akRFxeJjA4o7MVe",
