        {
          "rollDetails": [],
          "id": "vhRuuxAZkiU0q109rpWa",
          "description": "Occasionally seens as pets for those able to handle its wild nature or those too dumb to know better. Could be flavored as a Sandray, gliding through the air before resurfacing under the desert.",
