        "name": "Bedmunk Swarm",
        "subname": "Rank 2 Boss",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "details": "High strung and anxious creatures, Bedmunks travel in large swarms across landscapes, found in all biomes and weird places. They only seek to build the most pristine beds. After having used one, they find it tainted and seek out new areas for their next project.",
        "appearance": "",
