          "rollDetails": [],
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": [],
          "type": "Loot",
          "description": "Bedmunk Masterpiece.\r\nYou'll never be able to sleep like this again.\r\nEach Bedmunk Swarm has its masterpiece bed somewhere in the vicinity of the Fight.\r\nIf slept in, it acts as a Luxury Inn and additionally grants +1 Heart and +1 Aura [Relaxed] for the next Day.\r\nSleeping in it or disturbing it, however, ruins the bed. The Bedmunks' meticulous process is nearly magical and cannot be replicated.",
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
