          "id": "SWzyEP9q891EsFl7x1J5",
          "name": "Engulf.",
          "description": "The Bloop can attempt to engulf a Target within the same Area, trapping them inside its watery form. The Target must make a Deftness Check or be Engulfed.\nEffect: An Engulfed Target is lifted off the ground, floating with the Bloop. The target is considered Restrained. The Target can attempt to break free on their turn by making a successful Might Check. If the Bloop is popped by a piercing attack, the Target is immediately freed and falls prone (Toppled).",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "kSyJ0DBPufqwAPqRkJuE",
          "name": "Splish-Splash.",
          "description": "As an action, the Bloop can unleash a burst of water, drenching all Creatures in the same Area. This ability automatically activates on Death.\r\nEffect: The Bloop can also put out small fires or douse flaming enemies with this ability.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "NnTOvyotyLd9bF27eoCE",
          "name": "Bubbly Form.",
          "description": "The Bloop is highly vulnerable to piercing attacks, which can easily pop it.\nEffect: The Bloop takes double Damage from piercing weapons or attacks.",
