          "id": "iqM7bYIQoJlBYFKgHCWO",
          "name": "Luring Light.",
          "description": "The Bog Willow can emit a soft, bioluminescent glow from its drooping branches, mimicking the light of fireflies. All Creatures within 2 Areas must make an Insight Check or be drawn towards the Bog Willow, moving one Area closer.",
