      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "ukIA3rgWWyRJdRORlx7P",
          "name": "His Body is Temple\nYou never want for a spiritual place if you embody it, literally.",
          "description": "Brother Rollfast's Shell provides a +6 to Defense Rating.\n\nMundane Damage received is reduced by 1 Damage.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "bdSDGvaasaSSguVpUAQd",
          "name": "His Fists are Sermons\nOh, you'll definitely have a headache from 'overlearning' after this.",
          "description": "Brother Rollfast's fists strike as Dual-Wielding Mighty Weapons. He is a relative Pacifist, and will spare Foes. Any Injury he inflicts that would cause serious harm is reduced to its next lowest tier (e.g. Severed becomes Broken, Death becomes Out Cold).\n\nOn a Hit, the Target must make an Insight Check or become Disoriented. This effect can only affect a Target one time per Combat.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "xoONe07BBTgKrxu5GqNU",
          "name": "Brother Rollfast Rolls Fast\nThat dustcloud sure isn't a tumbleweed.",
          "description": "Once per Fight, Brother Rollfast can condense into his Ball Form. While in Ball Form, Brother Rollfast is Very Fast, gaining a +2 to Defense Rating.\n\nBrother Rollfast can end Ball Form by moving up to his full Speed, attacking anyone standing in an Area he flies through. A Hit from the Ball Form deals 3 Damage, on Hit, and the Target must make a Deftness Check or be Toppled.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "A9hvEWiKjzsSAVr0DHGJ",
          "name": "Need Not Be Said\nThe few disciples Brother Rollfast keeps on his travels know their worth and their conviction, no words needed.",
          "description": "Brother Rollfast is usually accompanied by a couple of Disciples [reskinned Murder Maid and Battle Butler]. A successful Attack or Ability directed towards Brother Rollfast is willingly deflected onto them while within the same Area of them. The Disciple suffers the effect of whatever was intended for Brother Rollfast and cannot parry or otherwise avoid it with a shield, ability, or other means. This Ability may be used once per Turn.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
