        "subname": "Rank 10 Mega-Boss",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "details": "Knowledge. Armadillo monk of the Iron Shell Dojo, a long-lost sect. Shell of runes, he roams endlessly now in search of those deserving of ancient knowledge.",
