            "id": "85buuWD5NGEkbwP1ipc6",
            "itemId": "0KOF5xtIxTOtFckxs0tb",
            "name": "Deva Blood Ink",
            "description": "Debated as to whether it truly is the blood of a Deva, this special ink is said to embody the ocean itself.\nAn Advanced Tailor may tattoo this ink onto a Person, imparting them the Deva's Breath ability, useable once-per-day.\n> Upon taking a true deep breath, the bearer of this tattoo may breathe underwater for the next hour.\n1 Unit | 1 Gem",
