          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "value": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiersPostCalculationFunc": null,
          "counters": {},
          "description": "Jovial and welcoming, though not wont to take banter. Brother Rollfast is tasked with proving the worth of any to-be-heros that ascend to spiritual locations in search of knowledge. He isn't particularly content with his role as a spiritual bridge but keeps up the task as his departed brethern \"would ridicule him non-stop in the afterlife if he were to ever stop\".",
          "name": "Role Playing Notes",
