      "notes": [
        {
          "description": "Anyone dumb enough or cruel enough to fight one of these will probably be swatted and played with like a small mouse, brining back fond memories of a young cat.\n- Hiss to warn to be left alone.\n- Give a smack to those who don't.",
          "counterOverrides": {},
