        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Yield",
          "rollDetails": [],
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": [],
          "type": "Loot",
          "description": "Cats of Prodigious Size might have trinkes from when they were still young or have collected as tributes after they grew to their prodigious size. Though some feral ones do exist, many frown on the killing and looting of these majestic creatures since it is considered really bad luck.",
