      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "igcEurtU36EyH1PuEI9F",
          "name": "TENTACULAR COMBAT.",
          "description": "The Changinc's tentacles offer much more than simple object manipulation. Each Turn, the Changinc can use one of the following attacks:\nExtended Strike: The Changinc can attack as though wielding a Slash Weapon.\nSweep Attack: The Changinc can attack as though wielding an Arc Weapon.\nGrab: On a successful Attack, a tentacle grabs and fully Restrains the Target. The Target can attempt to escape at the beginning of each turn by making a Might Check. The Changinc can Restrain a maximum of two enemies at a time.\nCrush: If the Changinc has a Target restrained, it can spend an Action to deal 1 Damage without needing to make an Attack.\n\nThe Changinc fights as if wielding two weapons.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "v0OJ9lIDj7QNfDAxBVSL",
          "name": "CAMOUFLAGE.",
          "description": "The Changinc can change its color to blend into its surroundings. While not fully invisible, it becomes significantly harder to notice for those who aren't expecting it.\n\nWhen camouflaged, you receive a Major Bonus when making Stealth Checks. If your Team is Exploring using Stealthy Movement (p. 234), you make an independent Stealth roll.\n\nAdditionally, when Camouflaged, even if your Team is using Cautious or Hasty Movement, you still benefit from the effects of Stealthy Movement. If you are camouflaged and discovered by a Map or Site Encounter, you may make a Stealth Check to remain hidden.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "SntKJj7LyBxK3DOvYNTs",
          "name": "MIMICRY.",
          "description": "The Changinc Impersonator can mimic the appearance of other beings using its long tentacles and its ability to alter color. It can moderately adjust its body structure, coloring, face, and height, although drastic changes in mass are not possible. The Changinc can only transform into a species of a similar size to its own.\n\nWhile it can speak and respond to questions to some degree, it can only do so based on the memories provided to it; other attempts at communication will not work. It has an Edge on any Checks involving adopting different personas to deceive others.\n\nThe Changinc requires an Action to transform, and it can freely revert back at will. If it loses a Heart, suffers an Injury, or is affected by a harmful effect, its transformation is disrupted.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D1TCu0u31id7H4VclJZ8",
          "name": "TENTACULAR MOVEMENT.",
          "description": "The Changinc is unaffected by the Isolated (p. 250) and Precarious (p. 251) Battlefield Conditions. It can climb vertical surfaces using even the smallest footholds, without being slowed down or needing to make a check.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
