      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "kZ1DNI2DvtCleUQeIqdy",
          "name": "Form of Smoke [B].",
          "description": "- Reduces Mundane Damage by 1 Heart.\n- Once per Combat, Clone of Viota can disperse into a cloud of smoke and move up to 2 Areas on her Turn, and still take her normal Action.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "qOGTHFNJNdVOYXMScv3y",
          "name": "Life Time of Lessons [A].",
          "description": "Clone of Viota gains a History related to the Homeland this version of her resides. She gains a Minor Bonus (+2) on Checks and Contests related to her History.\n\nAt the start of a Fight, she can select 1 Target and gain one of the following features:\n- Gain an Edge on Attacks made against them.\n- Gain an Edge on Checks or Contests against Magic Abilities used by them.\n\nClone of Viota can perfectly recall a past experience on one of her other clones, even if they have been slain.\n- Once per Combat, she can use this to grant herself an Edge on a Check or Contest.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "lhmBT64aIEyFIUER2xI1",
          "name": "Spectral Armaments [A].",
          "description": "Clone of Viota can conjure smoke versions of whatever Starting Gear her History would normally grant her.\n\nClone of Viota can also conjure a weapon, either a Standard or a Drawn Weapon. She conjures ammo along with the Drawn Weapon and is not concerned about ammo.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
