          "displayName": "Concealed Weapon",
          "details": [
            {
              "value": {
                "description": "Range: Melee\nDamage: 2\nThreshold: 22\n\nDrawing and striking with a Concealed Weapon is one Action.\n\n**Weapon Ability, Sneaky Swipe:**\nIf your target isn't aware of your Concealed Weapon you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight.\n- Your Target must be in the same Battlefield Area as you, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush.\n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush."
              },
              "visibility": "full",
              "type": "description"
            },
            {
              "visibility": "full",
              "value": {
                "image": {
