          "name": "Hypnotic Gaze.",
          "description": "The Dizzy Slithers can lock eyes with a creature, causing a hypnotic effect that disorients and confuses. The Target must make an Insight Check or be Stunned for 1 turn, unable to act as they become entranced.",
