      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "IZPHGNJTGLhn5DR162CB",
          "name": "Beast That Time Forgot [B].",
          "description": "Dominatelio Anax are extremely large predators from another era.\n\n- Dominatelio Anax are Massive.\n- Sweep Attack: Tail strikes as an Arc Weapon.\n- Focus Attack: Jaws strike as a Mighty Weapon.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "fFUip3xAQxkcwqPgVfiY",
          "name": "Therapod Hide [A].",
          "description": "Dominatelio Anax have extremely thick hides with boney plates, making them extremely difficult to hurt.\n\n- +8 Defence Rating\n- +1 Hearts Total\n- Speed Rating is Slow.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "pQoGEmFjW8KtkfktGGlU",
          "name": "Mage Killer [L].",
          "description": "Despite normally lumbering about slowly, making them relatively easy to escape from, woe betide any who attempt to use magic against these beasts. The D-Nax displays frightening speed and aggression towards those who dare.\n\nIf the Dominatelio Anax is targeted by a Magical Ability or effect, it may immediately move up to 2 Areas towards the offender. If it ends up in the same Area, it may immediately attack with its Focus Attack. The Magical Ability or effect resolves first, then this Ability, whether or not the Dominatelio Anax was affected by it. This is normal movement and may be blocked by any normal means of stopping movement such as the Isolated Area Condition, the Restrained Ailment, etc.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
