      "bio": {
        "background": "Created by: KeJoRo [Discord]",
        "size": "Massive",
        "name": "Dominatelio Anax",
        "subname": "Rank 8 Mega-Boss",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "details": "Despotic Lizard King. A terror from another era, the Dominatelio Anax, sometimes colloquially referred to as D-Nax, is a powerhouse of a dinosaur. Big, strong and territorial, if you stumble across one, sometimes it's better to run! Other powerful monsters may have fancy tricks or magical abilities. Not so the D-Nax. It has one strategy of brute force, which it performs terrifyingly well. For reasons unknown, magic seems particularly offensive to them and they will stop at nothing to destroy magic-users, even beyond any other reasonable animal behaviour.",
        "appearance": "",
        "characteristics": {
          "height": "",
          "skin": "",
          "weight": "",
          "age": "",
          "eyes": "",
          "hair": "",
          "gender": ""
        },
