          "description": "The Dragon can breathe into two Areas which must be adjacent to each other, and one of which must be the Dragon\u2019s Area or adjacent to it.\nImpact. All Creatures must make a Deftness Check or take 1 Damage and be Petrified. The Petrification can be ended by taking Fire Damage, or by the Petrified person/an ally spending an Action and making a Might Check.\r\nOngoing. The Area becomes Precarious.",
