        "name": "Gargoyle",
        "subname": "Rank 1 Boss",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "details": "Winged guardian that watches from the walls. A guardian construct enchanted with potent magic to guard a location, usually seen on castle walls and whatnot. They lie perfect still until a potential threat has entered their sight.",
