      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "Gqyi2zmFwzd4A57gVH3Z",
          "name": "Creepy Climber [B].\nJust like their namesake, Glass Skitters can climb on any surface, even ceilings. Nobody is quite sure how they can manage it considering they're made completely of glass, but it sure makes them a handy minion!",
          "description": "Glass Skitters ignore the Isolated and Precarious Area Conditions. They may move across any solid surface that can hold their tiny weight, regardless of gravity.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "G8CNdz5XjvtZsvvC7LxP",
          "name": "Born Of Mana [B][M]\nThey were made in the Heart Of Glass out of the excess mana of Ignis and Terra.",
          "description": "Despite having fully physical forms and being fully independent, their core is still made of mana and should anything happen to disrupt that, they will die.\n\nAnything that can disrupt or dispel magic will kill a Glass Skitter instantly. If this effect causes no physical damage to it, then it will remain a glass sculpture in the last pose it was in. You could probably sell it.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
      "speed-rating": {
