          "name": "Great Gulp.",
          "description": "Preceded by a strong exhale, Horfhogs use their powerful lungs to suck in creatures and objects around them. All Creatures in the same Area can choose to lose a random Item not stored in a Bag or make a Deftness Check to avoid being swallowed and Suffocated. You can attempt to escape on your subsequent Turn by succeeding a Might Check.",
