          "name": "Weariness Whiplash.",
          "description": "Upon detaching from the Hug Slug - willingly or unwillingly - the Holder makes an Aura Contest against the Hug Slug. On a Failure, all skipped Fatigue stacks instantly apply.\r\nThe Hug Slug also makes a Grit Check. On a Failure, its heart is broken and it dissolves.",
