            }
          }
        }
      },
      "hearts": {
        "current": 1,
        "tempMax": 0,
        "max": 1,
        "meterType": "hidden",
        "temp": 0
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "weapon",
          "version": 2,
          "id": "Eg8El4UQ8Ztb2FOaKttq",
          "displayName": "Standard Weapon",
          "details": [
            {
              "value": {
                "description": "Range: Melee\nDamage: 1\nThreshold: 20"
              },
              "type": "description",
              "visibility": "full"
            },
            {
              "value": {
                "image": {
                  "tokenCrop": {
                    "x": 0,
                    "height": 100,
                    "unit": "%",
                    "aspect": 1,
                    "y": 0,
                    "width": 100
                  },
                  "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2Fn9qXCE2Ylwj8dBmy4lpo%2Fimages%2FYm5Yte0sUUWUo8Yy32du.png?alt=media&token=8db28edf-a753-49db-9212-35430deb5e87"
                }
              },
              "visibility": "full",
              "type": "image"
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "encounterRoll": false,
              "name": "",
              "advantageType": "none",
              "modifiers": [
                {
                  "linkedValue": "attack-bonus.attributes.attack-bonus.value.value",
                  "operator": "add"
                }
              ],
              "hide": false,
              "useModifiers": true,
              "baseRoll": "1d20",
              "quantity": 1,
              "type": "roll",
              "bonus": 0,
              "selectedDie": "d20",
              "bonusRoll": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "JKa1llAzwZ9ZkFKJigw4",
          "name": "Synthetic [B].",
          "description": "A Klikabrik is a mechanical being.\n\n- Immune to Fatigue, Starvation and Suffocat\\ion.\n- Immune to toxins that target living tissue which are ingested, inhaled or injected.\n- Klikabrik are powered by an engine that feeds on ambient mana. If the flow of mana into the engine is interrupted they will then cease to function. They do however have a backup battery which they can recharge with electricity, though this discharges pretty quickly and they need to regularly recharge using any still-functioning recharge stations that can be found within a techruin.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "Lq1e5XxqUhxKVhKTD6MV",
          "name": "Magnetic Merging [B].",
          "description": "One Klikabrik by itself is barely an annoyance. Even several are only mildly annoying. However, when they start to combine into a single form, they can become quite formidable.\n\nA Klikabrik may spend an Action to connect to another Klikabrik in the same Area as long as it is not prevented from physically touching it for any reason. When it does so, in game mechanical terms it ceases to exist.\n\nA Klikabrik has an Attack and Hearts Total equal to the number of Klikabriks connected to it, including itself. Every time it loses a Heart for any reason, a Klikabrik connected to it is destroyed, meaning it also loses that amount from its Attack.\n\nWhenever the total number of Klikabriks combined together reaches a multiple of three, the whole being is considered one size category bigger, which changes its Aptitudes, Defence Rating and ability to attack, as described on pages 106, 434 and 435. A Klikabrik may never reach Colossal size using these rules, but the GM may decide that hundreds of them have come together to make a Colossal creature of their own creation.\n\nTiny - 1-2 | Small - 3-5 | Medium - 6-8 | Large - 9-11 | Massive - 12+",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "K04elf3i62pJETyBn5ua",
          "name": "Charged Attack [B].",
          "description": "A Klikabrik may surround their body with electricity before slamming themselves into an opponent. This stings a bit when they're alone, but can become quite dangerous when several of them have combined.\n\nA Klikabrik's strikes as though armed with a Standard Weapon that deals Lightning Damage.\n\nWhen Tiny, as normal for Tiny creatures, they cannot deal damage to anything larger than they are.\n\nWhen Massive, as normal for Massive creatures, they instead have a Focus and Sweep attack, both of which deal Lightning Damage.\nSweep Attack: Electrified spin strikes as an Arc Weapon.\nFocus Attack: Electrified slam strikes as a Mighty Weapon.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "vd6SzaLsv9NW0rMTmCWk",
          "name": "Electromagnetic Hover [B].\nUsing the awesome force of electromagnetism, a Klikabrik can rise into the air and keep itself there indefinitely. This concept seems to bewilder Dimensional Strays, who often complain that \"electromagnetism does not work that way\", which is preposterous. I mean, you can see them doing it!",
          "description": "Is that not proof enough, Strays?\n\nKlikabriks float about one metre from the ground at all times, meaning they can ignore any traps or Area Conditions that involve stepping on things. However, they are unable to climb unless they are able to repeatedly hover over another surface large enough so their entire body can fit onto it. They also immediately fall into water or other liquids unless they are less than a metre deep, so usually avoid attempting to cross.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
      "speed-rating": {
        "attributes": {
          "speed-rating": {
            "value": {
