      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "cRZItg1wVZnYKzWBr93m",
          "name": "Klaws That Scratch [B].",
          "description": "Kranky Klaws has extremely long, deadly claws at the end of his strong, oversized hands.\n\nKranky Klaws' Unarmed Attacks strike as Mighty Weapons.\nAfter a successful Attack with Klaws That Scratch, he may attempt a Might Contest. If successful, all of the Opponent's limbs are Restrained. He may have 2 Targets Restrained in this way, but may not use Klaws That Scratch or Bag Of Gifts while both his hands are full. He may release an opponent without spending an Action.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "VOAknFz1OY0m14V9TQos",
          "name": "Large And In Charge [A].",
          "description": "Kranky Klaws is a powerful figure and while the hushed whispers about him might sound like exaggerations, he really is as big as they say. Perhaps he used to be a Promethean in another life. A jolly Promethean, with charity in his heart.\n\n- Kranky Klaws is Large.\n- Kranky Klaws has Supernatural Might.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "volq7chYj7UN2qwf15Pi",
          "name": "Stocking Stuffer [A].",
          "description": "Kranky Klaws is mostly known for delivering his deadly gifts, but sometimes he decides to take one for himself.\n\nAs an Action, Kranky Klaws may place a Target Restrained by Klaws That Scratch into his Bag Of Gifts. Once inside, the Target is no longer Restrained, but begins the process of Petrification as they are slowly wrapped up as a gift. They may not exit the Bag until they have ended the Petrified Ailment by using the Turn to make a Might Check. If they fail to end the Ailment, they may only be freed after Kranky Klaws' death by someone spending an Action and a Might Check to rip open the gift. Once it has ended, they can escape by spending an Action to attempt a Might Check. The Bag Of Gifts may contain up to one Large creature, two Medium creatures or four Small creatures, or one Medium creature and two Small creatures. It may contain any number of Tiny creatures.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "hNleg8tyooffQp7pceEL",
          "name": "Slay Bells [A].",
          "description": "Despite his large size, Kranky Klaws is surprisingly nimble. The ominous sound of jingling bells plays as he rushes past with blinding speed.\n\nKranky Klaws' Speed is Very Fast. Once per Turn he may avoid a single Attack or Magical Ability as long as he has room to move and is not Restrained.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "odfv6Kbd4TEpMHzqcDyV",
          "name": "Bag Of Gifts [L].",
          "description": "Strapped to his back is a large bag filled with gifts. While some of these gifts are genuinely pleasant, many of them are deadly. He delights in gift-giving. Even in the midst of battle he cannot resist dispensing gifts to all.\n\nAt the start of each of his Turns, as long as he does not have 2 Target Restrained by Klaws That Scratch, Kranky Klaws automatically throws a gift without spending an Action. This has a range of up to 1 Area. Roll on the table below to determine which gift is bestowed. Kranky Klaws is never affected by his own gifts, naughty or nice.\n\n1-5 Nice Gift - Treat as a Grenade, but instead of dealing Damage it heals 1 Heart to anyone affected by it.\n6-15 Naughty Gift - Treat as a Grenade.\n16-20 Very Naughty Gift - Treat as a Bomb. This counts as setting the Bomb, so it explodes at the start of Kranky Klaws' next Turn.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
