        {
          "id": "xFqZuNCUnN5oZ0eiZ6Vb",
          "name": "Detachable Limbs.",
          "description": "Each limb is independently powered in case of separation from the main body and will continue to fight. \nSeparation reveals the Spell Engine. If it receives direct Damage from magic (spell or item), it has a chance to explode (1-5 on a D20). Exploded engines reduce yield.",
