          "name": "Brain in a Jar.",
          "description": "The brain controls the Magitech Kraken from inside the machine\u2019s body. It can be reasoned with.\nSundering Rule - Glass (10 Defence Rating, 4 Hearts)\nOnce exposed, the Brain begins to suffocate. It has 1 Heart.",
