              "selectedDie": "d20",
              "useModifiers": true,
              "baseRoll": "1d20",
              "bonusRoll": "",
              "bonus": 0
            }
          ],
          "details": [
            {
              "visibility": "full",
              "value": {
                "description": "Range: 1 Area\nDamage: 1\nThreshold: 22\n\n**Weapon Ability, Crack!**\nYou can Attack an enemy up to 1 Battlefield Area away."
              },
              "type": "description"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "visibility": "full",
              "value": {
                "image": {
                  "tokenCrop": {
                    "aspect": 1,
                    "height": 100,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "unit": "%",
                    "width": 100
                  },
                  "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2Fn9qXCE2Ylwj8dBmy4lpo%2Fimages%2FyiyBT1rWIG1sjDd0Xh7T.png?alt=media&token=7f344de5-f99c-4a20-884e-b25e1d21b03a"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "yaWXKRGoen67QFotxSA5",
          "name": "Puzzle Boss Marbled Gohma.",
          "description": "- This monster has a vulnerable Core, an eye that sits atop its body. This eye is the only part of the monster's body that can take Damage.\n- The monster's body is immune to Damage and Conditions, and the monster's eye cannot be targeted except from above while the monster still has legs.\n- Each of its 4 legs has 2 Hearts. At least 3 legs must be fully Sundered for the monster's main body to drop to the ground and expose the eye. The monster is considered Toppled during this time and its Turn is skipped when Toppled.\n- After 3 total Turns have passed, no matter whose Turns they are, the monster regrows its legs and stands, rendering the eye untargetable. If this results in the monster's turn getting skipped, the monster may immediately take 1 Action upon standing, no matter whose Turn it is.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "rB2te9hvDY5EuYsFjilw",
          "name": "Body Slam.",
          "description": "All enemies in the same Battlefield Area must make a Deftness Check. On Success, they only take 1 Damage. On Failure, they take 1 Damage and are Toppled.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "LgBr09xKkT6YeTRc1fCC",
          "name": "Rock Ring.",
          "description": "The monster chooses an Area on the ground up to 1 Area away. The monster spits a ring of lava boulders around that Area. All Large or smaller Creatures in that Area are considered trapped unless they can fly over or burrow under the boulders.\nEach boulder has 2 Hearts and a Defense of 10, and trapped Targets must Sunder at least 1 boulder before they can move to another Area. Once at least one boulder is Sundered, all trapped Creatures regain the ability to move to another Area.\nThe boulders explode at the beginning of the monster's next turn, dealing 3 Damage to unarmored/unshielded creatures, or Sundering armor or shields used to protect affected Creatures by 2 Hearts.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "R30WfroDQ7lIIdbXm94T",
          "name": "Rock Barrage.",
          "description": "The monster chooses 2 Areas up to 1 Area away and spits a lava boulder into each of them. The boulders explode at the beginning of the monster's next Turn, dealing 3 Damage to unarmored/unshielded Creatures, or Sundering armor or shields used to protect affected Creatures by 2 Hearts.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "Y3DdO6IA2eV2q8c4jbdF",
          "name": "Roof Dweller.",
          "description": "The monster inverts itself and jumps up to crawl along the ceiling. May only be used indoors with sufficient space. The monster can remain on the ceiling for up to 2 Turns, or until 2 of its legs are Sundered, which will cause it to drop to the ground, exposing its eye and becoming Toppled as per the Puzzle Boss: Marbled Gohma ability.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
