          "name": "Steam Blast.",
          "description": "Arc weapon that deals Fire Damage. Makes the Area used in Steamy. If an Area is already Steamy, makes it Obscured. Cannot be used 2 Turns in a row.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
