        {
          "id": "e3dnFHQUdquoyDn1hBwY",
          "name": "The Abyss Stares Back.",
          "description": "If spooked in any way (even just light eye-contact), the Petrifrog will hyperventilate and let out a horrifying human-like scream. It will squeeze its eyes tight before opening them with incredible radiant light. All Creatures in the same Area must make a Deftness Check to look away in time or be Petrified. Those wearing Blackout Goggles have an Edge on this roll.",
