          "id": "bbtKZbpdhbCwrKJiLqJc",
          "name": "Hiding in Plain Knot.",
          "description": "The Prestidigi-tie just looks like an ordinary pair of shoelace until it's time to strike. Requires an Insight Contest to detect that the lace is dubious. Those who can sense magic or use a Scanner have an Edge.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
