        },
        {
          "id": "ERR79qrmTaY8ihp0I5Y4",
          "name": "Bide and Bind.",
          "description": "The Prestidigi-tie inherits the sneaky intent of its creator. At the worst moments, the Prestidigi-tie will tie itself together, provoking a Deftness Check on its wearer or they become Toppled.",
