      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "oWF6JhNjYi8Eh5h8Vvap",
          "name": "Things That Go Bump In The Night [B].",
          "description": "Pum Kin are diminutive nocturnal troublemakers. They are roughly the same size as a goblin in high heels and share their ability to see in the dark.\n\n- Pum Kin are Small size. \n- Pum Kin can see in the dark.\n- Pum Kin are not affected by the Obscured Battlefield Condition if it is caused by darkness.\n- Pum Kin have a Snag while doing anything in bright light, unless their eyes are shaded.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "F9Z4HKxsnr35Dv09nget",
          "name": "Hollow Head [B].",
          "description": "A Pum Kin's head is hollow and perhaps more surprisingly they can remove the top of their head like a hat, revealing a convenient storage space. Many Pum Kin enjoy placing light sources inside their heads which shine ominously through their mouth, nose and eye holes.\n\nA Pum Kin may store an item up to 1 Inventory Slot inside their head, which they may retrieve as an Action.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ezCvCkXgN8JkDibKZa76",
          "name": "Kabocha Claws [B].",
          "description": "Despite being primarily made up of fruit and vines, at the end of a Pum Kin's viny arms are vicious claws that can leave nasty scratches to the unaware.\n\nThe Pum Kin makes Unarmed Attacks as if wielding a Quick Weapon.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
