      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "Wtq0V7pE7WqfvX0JXVvN",
          "name": "Things That Go Smash In The Night [B].",
          "description": "Pum Kings are enormous denizens of the night.\n\n- Pum Kings can see in the dark.\n- Pum Kings are not affected by the Obscured Battlefield Condition if it is caused by darkness.\n- Pum Kings have a snag while doing anything in bright light, unless their eyes are shaded.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "oOLDHtyigUODgikFHHcs",
          "name": "Giant Golias [B].",
          "description": "This very well may be the biggest fruit you've ever seen. It would probably take a village a week to eat all of it.\n\n- Pum Kings are Massive.\n- Sweep Attack: Long vines strike as Arc Weapons.\n- Focus Attack: Bites and hard leaves strike as Mighty Weapons.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "nPnX8UiW1Yg1vFKH3C8f",
          "name": "Tough Rind [B].",
          "description": "A Pum King's rind is incredibly tough, taking a great deal of effort to pierce.\n\n- +4 Defence Rating\n- +1 Heart's Total\n- Speed Rating is Slow",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "XhqeJ1l1jUTzf1XgR3YC",
          "name": "Soaring Squash [A]\nSpring-like vines coil beneath this titanic monster, allowing it to launch itself surprisingly high and far.",
          "description": "- Pum Kings have Supernatural Leaping.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "Jd2kh5zJNPoT1yu4EcM0",
          "name": "Crushing Calabaza [L].",
          "description": "What goes up must come down, and when something of this size comes down you'd better hope you aren't under it.\n\nWhen a Pum King uses Supernatural Leaping, all Creatures in the same Battlefield Area that it lands in takes 1 Damage. They must also make a Deftness Check to avoid being Toppled.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
