          "description": "Robogun can move vertically one Area in one Turn and can hover away from solid footing for the next 2 Turns. After this, it has to stay on the ground for 1 Turn before being able to move vertically again. If at the end of the 2 Turns it's still in the air, it crashes to the ground. It must save vs. Deft to halve damage (rounded down): 1 Damage per Area away from the ground at the beginning of the crash. Creatures in the Area of the crash must also save vs Deft to avoid the same Damage. The area becomes Obscured and Suffocating for 1 Turn per area away from the ground at the beginning of the crash or until the dust is swept away.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "PFjx06gcppvOyAIJXdpc",
          "name": "Efficient Plating.",
          "description": "Speed goes up by 1 Step.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "JfLCzFfYwojTrqXy0Au0",
          "name": "Bombs Away.",
          "description": "Missile barrage up to two Areas away, all Targets in that Area must save vs Deftness or take 1 Damage. The Area hit becomes Precarious until the rubble is taken away. It also becomes Obscured and Suffocating for 4 Turns or until the dust is swept away.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "NpqZ34ThZleptZ7qpMSn",
          "name": "Gas Bomb.",
          "description": "A massive noxious cloud is released up to two Areas away, all in the Area must make a Grit save or take 2 Damage and the Area becomes Harmful until cleansed. If the Area is not cleansed in the next two Turns all adjacent Areas become Harmful.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
