      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "CA7tIieMEJaJzYsAWlJ5",
          "name": "Mr.",
          "description": "10 Below.\nSome of these creatures have a penchant break out into song while fighting. Generally a rather catchy tune, too.\nAs an Action, the Snowmad can attempt to encase a Target in ice. Requires the Target to make a Grit Check. On a Target's Failure, they begin Petrifying to Ice (DR 14). Removing this Ailment mid-Fight requires the applied use of a heat source (i.e., an Action) for 2 Turns.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "fU8PVJHAiyYqW0gFn4Lt",
          "name": "Frosty Radiance.",
          "description": "Physicists argue that 'cold energy' doesn't exist. Tell them to stand next to one of these.\r\nThe Area in which the Snowmad stands is considered Harmful based on Extreme Cold.\r\nAn appropriate Outfit or source of heat negates this effect.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tTxFvLT9Sy76yZvaXuK2",
          "name": "I'm MELTING.",
          "description": "It may be magic snow but it still is just snow.\r\nAttacks doing Flame Damage are increased by 1 Damage.\r\nAttacks doing Frost Damage are reduced by 1 Damage.\r\nSnowmad within the range of a Star Gem take 1 Damage at the start of their Turn.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
