      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "BKwNLxmD5LGh1Euz9IV6",
          "name": "Artificial Vampire [B].",
          "description": "All of the strengths and only some of the weaknesses of one who lives in the night. With some strange conditions.\n\nA Synthister is only painfully affected by sunlight or a Star Gem if they are (mostly) naked from the neck down, completely melting into dark vapors and ash.\n- +1 Heart for their enhanced stamina and endurance.\n - A Synthister has an Edge on Sundering clothes and armor. Don\u2019t ask why.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "g36tOFh5waiPRtrsFhbW",
          "name": "Life Drain [B].",
          "description": "While they don\u2019t drink blood, they do drain just enough energy to leave their victims lethargic.\n\nOnce in the same Area as a Target, the Synthister will attempt to grapple and drain their life energy. On a successful Might Contest, the Synthister drains the Target of 1 Heart and inflicts 1 level of Fatigue.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "dsmK5VznOBUDsR7ApFCD",
          "name": "Hyper Drink [B].",
          "description": "An energy drink with so many herbs and medicines packed into it it shouldn\u2019t exist, much less be legally sold.\n\nWhen backed into a corner, a Synthister can spend an Action to knock back a can of this energy drink, gaining an Edge on all Might Checks and a +2 to Attack rolls.\n\nUnfortunately, the drink immediately gives the one who drank it intense headaches and a level of Fatigue.",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
