      "notes": [
        {
          "description": "The Angry first attacks the nearest foe, and thereafter whichever foe harmed it most recently, taking damaged to gain the Maddened damage bonus on as many of its Attacks as possible, and to provoke its Vicious Outburst.\n\nIf it starts its turn Seething or Enraged, it uses Shrieking Charge instead of Duel-Wielding its Hook Hands.",
