          "name": "Leeching Bite.",
          "description": "Make an Attack Roll, no Damage on a Hit.\n\nOn Success, The Wretched attaches to the Target. While attached, it cannot Attack. At the beginning of its Turn, it deals 1 Dark Damage to the Creature it's attached to.",
