          "description": "The Yeeti's paws strike as Standard weapons. After a successful Attack against a smaller Target, the Target must make a Might Check. On Failure, they are Restrained. A Yeeti may hurl a Restrained character 2 Areas, dealing 1 Damage and Toppling them in the process.",
